{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/"},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/c6377dd9ce6a1c2cd100eb4344e843eb4639b9ed26f84643f77680e9eb454c4b/$/index","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--FR6wIiUwvI9QnAjg7boU6--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/59c53da59c4783e3.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-b1e2483a7e02feee.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-7f6081441c67b1a1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/page-dd8ff9f8efbc9895.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Kers Secure — Protect &amp; Monetize your scripts</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Private Lua/Luau hosting, licensing and access control.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><!--$--><main><nav class=\"lnav\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">K</span><span class=\"brand-gold\">Kers Secure</span></a><div class=\"lnav-links\"><a href=\"/docs\">Docs</a><a href=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard</a><a href=\"#features\">Features</a><a href=\"#faq\">F.A.Q</a><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></div><div class=\"lnav-auth\"><a class=\"lnav-signin\" href=\"/login\">Sign in with Discord</a><a class=\"btn gold\" href=\"/login\">Sign in</a></div></nav><section class=\"lhero\"><h1>Protect &amp; Monetize your code<br/>with <span class=\"gold\">Kers Secure</span></h1><p>The standard and go-to solution for protecting, monetizing,<br/>and managing your scripts easily.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn gold\" href=\"/login\">Sign in with Discord</a><a href=\"#features\" class=\"btn outline\">See features</a></div><div class=\"hero-panel\"><div class=\"panel-bar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"panel-title\">KERS SECURE / WORKSPACE OVERVIEW</span></div><div class=\"panel-preview\"><div class=\"preview-side\"><div class=\"preview-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></div><div class=\"preview-line gold-line\" style=\"width:64%\"></div><div class=\"preview-line\" style=\"width:74%\"></div><div class=\"preview-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></div><div class=\"preview-line\" style=\"width:68%\"></div></div><div class=\"preview-main\"><div class=\"eyebrow gold-eyebrow\">WORKSPACE OVERVIEW</div><h3>Your scripts, locked down.</h3><div class=\"preview-stats\"><div class=\"preview-stat\"><span class=\"muted\">Projects</span><b>—</b></div><div class=\"preview-stat\"><span class=\"muted\">Hosted scripts</span><b>—</b></div><div class=\"preview-stat\"><span class=\"muted\">Licenses</span><b>—</b></div></div><div class=\"panel-note\">Keys, devices and executions are checked server-side on every load.</div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"lsec\"><h2>A <span class=\"gold\">stability-first</span> approach to whitelist security.</h2><p class=\"lsub\">Built with <span class=\"gold\">security</span> and <span class=\"gold\">stability</span> in mind.</p><a class=\"lsec-link\" href=\"/docs\">See how it exactly works →</a><div class=\"mini-grid\"><div><div class=\"mini-icon\">⚡</div><h3>Super Fast</h3><p>Kers Secure runs on Cloudflare&#x27;s edge network, so whitelist checks come back in milliseconds and your users never wait on a load.</p></div><div><div class=\"mini-icon\">🔧</div><h3>Easy to Integrate</h3><p>Upload your script to the dashboard and you are done. The whitelist and licensing layer is applied automatically on every delivery.</p></div><div><div class=\"mini-icon\">🔒</div><h3>Top Security</h3><p>Keys are HMAC-hashed, devices are fingerprinted and every execution decision is logged server-side. Your source never ships unchecked.</p></div><div><div class=\"mini-icon\">📈</div><h3>Reliable</h3><p>Edge deployment means 99.9%+ uptime for your script loads. Your users will never see whitelist related downtime.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"lsec\"><h2>Powerful <span class=\"gold\">Features</span> You&#x27;ll Love</h2><p class=\"lsub\">Everything you need to manage your scripts and users automatically.</p><div class=\"feat-grid\"><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">🤖</div><h3>Discord Authentication</h3><p>Secure Discord OAuth2 sign-in with owner, administrator and user roles.</p></article><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">🔑</div><h3>Key Stocking</h3><p>Generate day-locked or lifetime license keys per project and hand them out on your own storefront or community.</p></article><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">📜</div><h3>Device Binding</h3><p>Every key is bound to a hardware fingerprint with configurable device limits, so shared keys stop working on their own.</p></article><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">🛑</div><h3>One Click Kill Switch</h3><p>Suspend or revoke a license anytime and it takes effect immediately for future executions.</p></article><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">🗂️</div><h3>Private Script Hosting</h3><p>Store Lua and Luau releases in private object storage with version history, never exposed to the public web.</p></article><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">🗝️</div><h3>Key Check API</h3><p>The loader checks key details before the script ever runs, so invalid, expired or suspended keys fail before payload delivery.</p></article><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">📊</div><h3>Execution Logs</h3><p>Every authorization decision is recorded with outcome and reason, making support and abuse tracking straightforward.</p></article><article><div class=\"feat-icon\">🛡️</div><h3>Automatic Integration</h3><p>The Luarmor-style bootstrap loader is served straight from your script URL. One loadstring line and your users are in.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"lsec\"><h2>Here are our stats</h2><p class=\"lsub\">Actively used by script developers.</p><div class=\"stats-band\"><div><h3>99.9%</h3><p>Uptime on script loads</p></div><div><h3>&lt;100ms</h3><p>Median whitelist check</p></div><div><h3>24/7</h3><p>Edge coverage worldwide</p></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"lsec\"><h2>Simple and Flat Pricing</h2><p class=\"lsub\">Choose the plan that&#x27;s right for you.</p><div class=\"price-grid\"><div class=\"price-card\"><h3>Basic</h3><p class=\"price-sub\">If you just started developing scripts, this plan is ideal for you.</p><div class=\"price-line\"><span class=\"price-num\">$5</span><span class=\"price-per\">/month</span></div><ul><li>✓ 1 project folder</li><li>✓ Up to 2 scripts at once</li><li>✓ Up to 100 keys at once</li><li>✓ Device binding</li><li>✓ Execution logs</li><li class=\"off\">× Webhook logs</li></ul><a class=\"btn outline wide\" href=\"/login\">Get started</a></div><div class=\"price-card popular\"><div class=\"pop-badge\">Most Popular</div><h3>Premium</h3><p class=\"price-sub\">Best plan for most users. If your script hub is growing fast, this plan is recommended.</p><div class=\"price-line\"><span class=\"price-num\">$10</span><span class=\"price-per\">/month</span></div><ul><li>✓ 3 project folders</li><li>✓ Up to 8 scripts at once</li><li>✓ Up to 500 keys at once</li><li>✓ Device binding</li><li>✓ Execution logs</li><li>✓ Priority support</li></ul><a class=\"btn gold wide\" href=\"/login\">Get started</a></div><div class=\"price-card\"><h3>Pro</h3><p class=\"price-sub\">Everything in Premium with higher usage limits for established hubs.</p><div class=\"price-line\"><span class=\"price-num\">$20</span><span class=\"price-per\">/month</span></div><ul><li>✓ 6 project folders</li><li>✓ Up to 18 scripts at once</li><li>✓ Up to 2,000 keys at once</li><li>✓ Device binding</li><li>✓ Execution logs</li><li>✓ Priority support</li></ul><a class=\"btn outline wide\" href=\"/login\">Get started</a></div><div class=\"price-card\"><h3>Enterprise</h3><p class=\"price-sub\">For large hubs with specialized needs. Custom limits and features on request.</p><div class=\"price-line\"><span class=\"price-num\">Custom</span></div><ul><li>💎 Custom limits</li><li>💎 Custom loader options</li><li>💎 Dedicated support</li><li>✓ Everything in Pro</li></ul><a class=\"btn outline wide\" href=\"/docs\">Contact us</a></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"lsec\"><h2>Frequently asked <span class=\"gold\">questions</span></h2><div class=\"faq-list\"><div class=\"faq-item\"><b>How do I sign in?</b><p>Use the private owner API key on the sign-in page. Access is restricted to the owner.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><b>How do users run my script?</b><p>They run a single loadstring line pointing at your script&#x27;s loader URL, optionally with their key attached. The loader checks the whitelist, binds the device and then runs the script.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><b>What happens when a key runs out of devices?</b><p>The loader denies the execution and reports the reason. You can see every denial and its cause in your project logs.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><b>Can I turn a key off instantly?</b><p>Yes. Suspending or revoking a license takes effect on the very next execution.</p></div></div></section><footer class=\"lfooter\"><div class=\"lfooter-grid\"><div><div class=\"brand\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">K</span><span class=\"brand-gold\">Kers Secure</span></div><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:12px;max-width:280px;line-height:1.8\">Protect, monetize and manage your Lua and Luau scripts with per-key licensing and device binding.</p></div><div><h4>Product</h4><a href=\"/docs\">Documentation</a><a href=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard</a><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></div><div><h4>Resources</h4><a href=\"#features\">Features</a><a href=\"#faq\">F.A.Q</a><a href=\"/docs\">API Documentation</a></div></div><div class=\"lfooter-bottom\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Kers Secure · Not affiliated with Luarmor or Roblox.</div></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[2619,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-dd8ff9f8efbc9895.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n10:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/59c53da59c4783e3.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"FR6wIiUwvI9QnAjg7boU6\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/59c53da59c4783e3.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"body\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"templateScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",null,{\\\"children\\